136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 20 0 R
/E (The XL6009 module steps up 12V to 46V, utilizing N/P-ch MOSFETs for solenoid switching. Previously, a P-ch MOSFET limited the solenoid's power. To overcome this, we adopted a high-performance N-channel MOSFET to maximize kick power. To protect the microcontroller from this high-voltage signal, the AQW212 photocoupler provides electrical isolation.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [115]
>>
endobj
