/P 20 0 R
/E (We selected the Teensy 4.1 as our main microcontroller because it offers many UART ports and simple debugging. Additionally, we equipped two ESP32S3 sub microcontrollers for communication and UI processing. These components have increased the robot's real-time processing capabilities, leading to a much faster performance.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [162]
>>
